      "Servers can now update themselves: an Update code button per server pulls the latest code from a private repository and restarts that server's jobs \u2014 no more walking to the machine, running Connect and remembering to restart. Each server also shows the exact code version it is running next to its name, so \u201cis the fix live on that box?\u201d is answered by looking. An update is refused while a server is actively trading, enforcing the no-deploys-mid-session rule by software.",
