      "Your profit and loss is now priced from IBKR, not from the publisher's spreadsheet. His sheet kept revising prices long after the exchange closed \u2014 Zalando wandered from 22.58 to 22.70 to 22.78 over forty minutes on a shut market \u2014 and your P&L followed it, moving \u20ac2.20 on a position that had not traded. Your purchase price was always your own; it was today's price that came from the wrong place.",
